=== decision_cost microbench v4 (correlated workload, IndexedHeap, p50/p99/MAX) ===

--- workload realism: page occupancy + reclaimable distribution ---
{"n_pages": 1000, "n_events": 54807, "frac_free_pages": 0.009, "frac_full_pages": 0.991, "frac_partial_pages": 0.0, "mean_reclaimable_per_sample": 9.2}
{"n_pages": 4000, "n_events": 89488, "frac_free_pages": 0.032, "frac_full_pages": 0.968, "frac_partial_pages": 0.0, "mean_reclaimable_per_sample": 127.9}
(bimodal: free+full >> partial; reclaimable pages are RARE under pressure)

--- (2) per-op maintenance: IndexedHeap vs LRU (batch-timed, 3 seeds, P=4000) ---
{"seed": 0, "maintenance_events": 61567, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1268.6, "lru_ns_per_ev": 342.1, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 3.71}
{"seed": 1, "maintenance_events": 62340, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1217.4, "lru_ns_per_ev": 323.0, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 3.77}
{"seed": 2, "maintenance_events": 60756, "inc_ns_per_ev": 1206.5, "lru_ns_per_ev": 271.8, "ratio_inc_over_lru": 4.44}
per-op ratio Indexed/LRU (batch-timed): [3.71, 3.77, 4.44]  (target <= ~3x)
bare-op IndexedHeap.update / OrderedDict.move = 4.63x

--- (1)+(3) query latency vs P: LazyHeap(prod) vs IndexedHeap(fix) vs naive O(P) ---
  reporting p50 / p99 / MAX (the mean hides the lazy-delete O(P) spikes):
{"n_pages": 1000, "lazy_p50": 250, "lazy_p99": 3920, "lazy_MAX": 1199561, "idx_p50": 140, "idx_p99": 210, "idx_MAX": 6550, "naive_mean": 38730.3, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
{"n_pages": 4000, "lazy_p50": 290, "lazy_p99": 7010, "lazy_MAX": 6834457, "idx_p50": 150, "idx_p99": 340, "idx_MAX": 7050, "naive_mean": 163977.0, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
{"n_pages": 16000, "lazy_p50": 540, "lazy_p99": 11511, "lazy_MAX": 51935261, "idx_p50": 250, "idx_p99": 540, "idx_MAX": 6580, "naive_mean": 746654.8, "viols_lazy": 0, "viols_idx": 0}
  (LazyHeap MAX = O(P) trim spikes; IndexedHeap MAX stays ~µs => the fix)

--- (1b) query STRUCTURAL complexity: fixed churn, vary P (IndexedHeap, isolates O(log P)) ---
{"n_pages": 1000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "peek_MAX_ns": 6650}
{"n_pages": 4000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "peek_MAX_ns": 6150}
{"n_pages": 16000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "peek_MAX_ns": 6040}
{"n_pages": 64000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "peek_MAX_ns": 6110}
{"n_pages": 256000, "peek_p50_ns": 140, "peek_MAX_ns": 820}
  (IndexedHeap: p50 AND max flat in P — no O(P) tail, unlike LazyHeap)

